# The Pi serves these verbatim and runs the scripts under bash, where a
# stray CR is a syntax error. Normalise on commit and check out LF
# everywhere, so editing from Windows cannot reintroduce CRLF the way a
# Python io.open(...,'w') pass once did to the HTML.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
